<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Match 9-month profit falls 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish Match 9-month profit falls 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30,</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			  1,037   vs  1,223</p>
<p> Sales				     5,436   vs  5,535</p>
<p> Operating costs			 4,013   vs  4,299</p>
<p> Depreciation				214   vs    221</p>
<p> Associate interests			14   vs     17</p>
<p> Non-recurring items	    CHARGE 123   vs    261 CREDIT</p>
<p> Operating profit			1,100   vs  1,293</p>
<p> Net financial items			63   vs     70</p>
<p> Tax					   323   vs    367</p>
<p> Minorities			 CREDIT   1   vs	3 CHARGE</p>
<p> Net profit				  715   vs    853</p>
<p>NOTE -- Swedish Match makes matches, lighters, tobacco products and confectionery.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
